WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.8 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Accountability and reporting lines

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Accountability runs upward, sideways and downward to the people you serve.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. For each direction, set content, format and frequency.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Explain decisions to communities, not only to funders.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Inside the team, separate learning from blame.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: quarterly dashboard to the board; termly “you said, we did” posters in each club for the girls.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create an accountability map and internal accountability routine.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
